                <span class="text-amber-300 font-extrabold drop-shadow-[0_1px_8px_rgba(251,191,36,0.25)]">Время намаза</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-100 font-medium">(Уфа)</span>
              </h2>

              <!-- Enlarged Miladi/Hijri Line -->
